OL,3,GNEWSAThree held as explosives found in
OL,4,Ahouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bomb squad was called to deal with
OL,7,Fammunition and explosives found at a
OL,8,Fhouse in Tameside.
OL,10,FThree people were arrested over the
OL,11,Fdiscovery made on Wednesday afternoon
OL,12,Fby police who had gone to a property on
OL,13,FShelley Grove in Droylsden as part of
OL,14,Fan "unrelated investigation".
OL,16,FNearby homes were evacuated and a
OL,17,Fcordon was put in place while an
OL,18,Fexplosive ordnance disposal unit worked
OL,19,Fto make the area safe, Greater
OL,20,FManchester Police said.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
