OL,3,GNEWSAThree held as explosives found in
OL,4,Ahouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers arrested a man in his 20s on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of criminal damage, arson and
OL,8,Fpossession of ammunition, while a man
OL,9,Fin his 70s and a woman in her 60s were
OL,10,Fheld on suspicion of unlawfully
OL,11,Fpossessing ammunition and explosive
OL,12,Fsubstances.
